From 4da28a04e7de9ae60ac93edbea65c63f0549280e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d-b-c-e <anthony.mason1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 21:23:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 083/181] Add the centring spring the FFB Arcade Plugin has and
